{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國天團Big Bang慶祝出道20周年，暌違9年再度來港，昨晚（13日）於啟德主場館正式展開一連4場香港站演唱會。</p><p>3子合體引爆全城熱話，不僅吸引大批樂迷入場亮起經典「皇冠燈海」，更吸引一眾本地藝人化身「小粉絲」朝聖睇騷！</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T01:17:22.530511+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T01:03:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T01:10:34.324388+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T01:10:34.324388+00:00","content_hash":"cb72282b1095d9e84618bcf08e3c4021c5a47cb2fcc9f083473f9b49cce8d10d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}